        <activityName xml:lang="en">Natural rubber based sealing, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Natural rubber based sealing, at plant
Caoutchouc is approximated by the dataset "Chemicals, organic". Included are white spirit and the required transportation by rail and road, and hydrocarbon emissions to air. This dataset does not include any energy consumption during the production phase.;
UUID: 9e63f748-1426-3f3f-a9f2-2524bfd8a918
The dataset describes the production of a rubber-based sealing compound to be used e.g. in the aluminium cladding production. 
Location: Data retrieved from a safety data sheet by a German producer. Applicable for Europe.
Technology: Simple mass balance including transport. No process energy included.
Time period: undefined
Production volume: na
Sampling: Company information 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: Representative for Germany.
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_9e63f748-1426-3f3f-a9f2-2524bfd8a918.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
